        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055570/extras/42b6beb084ecdb9ea9a91d6ae040897a.avif?t=1761929884\" width=555 height=262 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have found a strange ad at your local convenience store advertising $100 a week to be someone’s friend. The catch? The girl is an incredibly lonely girl named “Hana” with a strange, high-pitched voice. Regardless of how you treat Hana, one thing is for certain: she is desperate for friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055570/extras/c2c14ad31416a53ab7a468527cf8045c.avif?t=1761929884\" width=616 height=324 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your New Friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hana Mendoza</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birthday: October 13th 1999</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sexuality: Desperate (bi/pan)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gender: Cis Woman She/Her</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 19</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height: 5’3’’</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personality: Sensitive, Clumsy, Lonely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occupation: College Student</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to play as cis, trans, or various other genders  (She/Her, They/Them, He/Him)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25K words of girl failure interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About an hour and a half of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partially voiced</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to mute voice acting</p></li></ul>",
